# Design system

When adding or changing product UI, use `library/src/components` and `library/src/tokens.css`.

- Compose screens from existing components such as `Button`, the sidebar, cards, and `Notification`.
- Color, type, and elevation come from tokens (`--typography-*`, `--background-*`, `--liq-*`, `--type-*`, `--outline-*`). Do not add raw hex, one-off fonts, or the older `fy-btn` styles for new UI.
- If a piece does not exist, add it under `library/src/components` and style it only with those tokens.
- Apply the change on the main app (`src`, http://localhost:5173), not only the library preview on port 5176. The preview can use the same components, but the main dashboard and transactions page are what must show the result.
